# L §3.3: "Anything else (rate × money, rate + num) is refused at load."
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "a source"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
unit hour "godzina"

input wibor: rate
input x: num

ask q1: wibor + x
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT ...
